# The repo is public: nothing that holds family data may ever be tracked.
# Databases and their backups (data/ is ignored above; these catch a copy
# pulled from the server into the project folder) …
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.*.bak
*.sqlite
# … and DECRYPTED exports: «Daten exportieren» in the app and
# `node scripts/export-plain.mjs … > export.json` (README) write plaintext.
export*.json
baby-tracker-export-*.json

# Artwork an installation shows to ONE family only (README › Private
# artwork): packaged and served behind the session, never published.
private-art/
/.e2e/
